{"code":"N15","wikidata":"Q96075530","wikipedia":{"en":"Bang Bua BTS station","th":"สถานีบางบัว"},"summary":{"en":"Bang Bua Station is a BTS Skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit Line in Bangkok, Thailand. It is located in front of the Bang Khen Main Campus of Sripatum University and Bang Bua School. The station is part of the northern extension of the Sukhumvit Line and opened on 5 June 2020, as part of phase 3.","th":"สถานีบางบัว เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนพหลโยธินในพื้นที่เขตจตุจักร กรุงเทพมหานคร เปิดให้บริการเมื่อวันที่ 5 มิถุนายน พ.ศ."},"opened":"2020-06-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/BTS_Bang_Bua_-_Station_toward_SPU.jpg/960px-BTS_Bang_Bua_-_Station_toward_SPU.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Bang_Bua_-_Station_toward_SPU.jpg","author":"Rachasak Ragkamnerd","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/BTS_Bang_Bua_-_Bang_Bua_canal_pedestrian_bridge.jpg/960px-BTS_Bang_Bua_-_Bang_Bua_canal_pedestrian_bridge.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Bang_Bua_-_Bang_Bua_canal_pedestrian_bridge.jpg","author":"Rachasak Ragkamnerd","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/BTS_Bang_Bua_-_Bang_Bua_canal_side_entrance.jpg/960px-BTS_Bang_Bua_-_Bang_Bua_canal_side_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Bang_Bua_-_Bang_Bua_canal_side_entrance.jpg","author":"Rachasak Ragkamnerd","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/BTS_Bang_Bua_-_Bang_Bua_school.jpg/960px-BTS_Bang_Bua_-_Bang_Bua_school.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imag